<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to December 13.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Village Roadshow	   4.90	     8.41</p>
<p>2   Village prefs		3.50	     7.69</p>
<p>3   BTR &quot;A&quot; shares	     5.05	     7.22</p>
<p>4   Email			  3.76	     6.82</p>
